==Battleground==
*1 [[Golden Doge]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*3 [[Golden Doge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*9 [[Golden Doge]]s spawn after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Golden Doge]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 96.67~100 seconds<sup>2,900f~3,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 96.67~100 seconds<sup>2,900f~3,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 103.33 seconds<sup>3,100f</sup>, delay 96.67~100 seconds<sup>2,900f~3,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gold Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Golden Doge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Golden Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

==Trivia==
